<!--
    RfSettingsDialog - FS25_SettingsHub
    The Realistic Farming Control Center: Settings tab.

    Sibling of RfKeybindActionDialog. Same proven idiom: a fixed pool of row
    elements declared here and filled from Lua, with pagination instead of
    runtime element creation. Rows are flattened from g_settingsHub:getModules()
    (every registered setting across the suite), and each row edits through the
    shipped g_settingsHub:setValue write path (validate -> route by scope ->
    persist -> sync). Admin (server-shared) settings are editable only for the
    host / a master user; locked and greyed for everyone else.

    COLUMN GEOMETRY. Row container 880px wide, half-width 440. Anchored at the
    element centre, widths matched between header and data cell per column.

      Column    Width   Centre
      Module    150px   -350px
      Setting   320px   -110px
      Value     110px   +240px
      [-] step   34px   +330px
      [+] step   34px   +378px

    Rightmost edge +395px, inside the 440px half-width.

    Step buttons extend fs25_wideButton, NOT buttonActivate: buttonActivate
    inherits MENU_ACTIVATE and paints a SPACE chip that shoves its label out of
    the box. Proven live 2026-08-22 on the keybind dialog.
-->
